5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should ensure our choice is based on actual utility rather than just the strength of a department's proposal.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We need to understand how these projects impact our daily operations and room availability.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,And we cannot ignore the people maintaining these facilities. The human cost of these improvements is often overlooked.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We also need to be realistic about delivery. Too many projects seem to drift past their deadlines.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. I am interested in whether our budget projections actually align with current market realities.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, which data would best reveal if previous projects actually satisfied the users?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Post-occupancy review ratings would be a start, as would booking data for the rooms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I'd like to see the staffing posts since the hiring freeze to see who is left to manage this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I want to look into the site diaries and the delivery schedules to find the cause of these slips.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll examine the tender records and the renewal reserves to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will take the post-occupancy reviews and the booking data then.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the timetable records for rooms out of service and the booking data as well.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I'll add the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to my list.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll stick with weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,That seems a balanced distribution of research.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
