35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"It appears general-purpose spaces are highly valued, while specialist rooms often sit idle.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"My findings confirm that. Also, taking rooms out of service is costing us a fortune in off-site rentals.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The technicians are struggling. They are spending hours on manual tasks that modern equipment should handle.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have a risk problem. Outdoor work is plagued by weather delays, and ""comfort"" projects almost always slip.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The market is volatile. Mechanical and ducting costs have jumped twenty percent, while basic surfacing remains stable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, if the technicians are overburdened, would a facility upgrade that automates their routines help?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,We must consider if such an upgrade requires taking critical rooms out of service for long periods.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,Any reduction in manual checks would be a godsend for the remaining staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"But if it involves complex mechanical work, Benjamin's cost warnings and my scheduling fears apply.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Mechanical plant lots are the most expensive and unpredictable right now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a project that serves many people but doesn't bankrupt us or take years to finish.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,A project with minimal room displacement would be ideal to avoid those rental costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I still believe we must address the technician's burden; it's a breaking point.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"We should avoid anything heavily exposed to the weather or based purely on ""appeal.""","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I suggest we steer clear of high-end mechanical overhauls if we want to stay on budget.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
