60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Looking at the candidates, the Central Study Commons (B) aligns with the high demand for general space.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"(B) is attractive, but the Media Production Center (D) also offers bookable space. However, (B) seems less disruptive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,The Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade (A) is the only one that directly helps the technicians' manual routines.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,(A) is a mechanical nightmare for the budget and schedule. The Path Network (C) is exposed to weather.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,(A) is far too risky financially. (C) is the most stable in terms of tender costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,(C) doesn't provide the indoor utility the users are craving. (B) is a much better use of space.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"(B) converts an underused hall, meaning we likely won't need expensive off-site room replacements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"I understand the risks of (A), but the staff cannot continue like this. Is there no middle ground?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,(B) is an internal conversion. It avoids the weather delays of (C) and the complexity of (A).,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,(B) is a safe bet. It avoids the volatile mechanical market and the risks of outdoor construction.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I'm convinced (B) is the most logical choice for user satisfaction and accessibility.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It solves the general room shortage without the timetable chaos.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"If the others are against (A), I cannot fight it, though the technicians will be disappointed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,(B) is the most likely to actually be delivered on time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It is the most fiscally responsible choice given the current tender trends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us vote.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,George,,Very well.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Ready.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Ready.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
